How I Would Approach It
Though I haven’t used Crossplane extensively in my professional experience, here’s how I envision setting it up:

Organize Resource Types
Separate resources into dedicated repositories for better manageability.
Integrate with ArgoCD
Use ArgoCD to sync these repositories with your Kubernetes cluster.
Complex Resources
